WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.297
Drone systems combine aircraft safety with account, software, communications, and data security.

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:13.061
Protect controller and application accounts with unique passwords and multi-factor authentication where available.

00:00:13.061 --> 00:00:17.025
Remove former users and limit administrative privileges.

00:00:17.025 --> 00:00:21.457
Maintain firmware and applications through an approved process.

00:00:21.457 --> 00:00:26.821
Review significant changes before operational use and confirm settings afterward.

00:00:26.821 --> 00:00:36.383
Updates can improve security and reliability, but an untested change immediately before a critical mission may create operational uncertainty.

00:00:36.383 --> 00:00:43.146
Collected imagery can reveal people, homes, routines, access points, infrastructure, or sensitive operations.

00:00:43.146 --> 00:00:52.709
Restrict access, use encrypted storage and transfer where appropriate, and retain only what the legitimate mission and policy require.

00:00:52.709 --> 00:00:55.274
Respect privacy and property.

00:00:55.274 --> 00:01:05.769
Notify or obtain consent where required, avoid private areas and unnecessary identification, and position sensors to collect the minimum useful data.

00:01:05.769 --> 00:01:11.133
A technically legal flight can still be intrusive or unethical.

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:20.695
Do not use drones for harassment, stalking, unlawful surveillance, interference with aircraft, evasion of law enforcement, or unsafe activity.

00:01:20.695 --> 00:01:25.127
Do not bypass flight restrictions or conceal accountability.

00:01:25.127 --> 00:01:30.957
Security and public-safety missions still require defined authority and proportional controls.

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:39.587
Ethical operation asks whether the mission is necessary, proportionate, and explainable to affected people and accountable reviewers.

00:01:39.587 --> 00:01:47.749
Protect sensitive findings, document decisions, and stop when safety, authority, privacy, or trust cannot be maintained.
